&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=772da85e459ac4c237d1527cc22faefc, https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6765f6c9045fd558354dec0385c8c3f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d0e4cc97c00bc041557f827224bfabf 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f96c024cd201b705b586878e9b83519", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f96c024cd201b705b586878e9b83519, https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2aabc3483a40a0e6c60937301f21dea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/566365b0/uploads/origins/29029bbb-b335-4197-9af8-92d199071a5c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d8ef6d50c0cc747827402d6269001626 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Tomoe Togami and I am a VTuber.\nI would like to request an illustration of Tomoe Togami, as I saw an illustration that attracted me very much.\n\nSince we don't have a three-sided drawing, I have prepared a pose that would serve as a reference as much as possible.\nhttp://dp01001873.lolipop.jp/image/image_1000_0000.webp\n\nWe would like to use them for thumbnails and other distribution purposes, so please see our request below.\n(We are also considering using them for posting on support sites, members-only contents, and neppuri, etc., but we will not use them for any directly money-generating purposes, such as production or sale of goods.)\n\nWe would like to request illustrations for use as thumbnails for \"Mobile Suit Gundam Battle Operation 2,\" which we are playing in the distribution. Specifically, we would like an illustration that looks like a cut-in, similar to the illustrations in the Super Robot Wars and Mobile Suit Gundam Extreme Versus series. If possible, we would also like to have a differential expression of a crying face after losing a lot.\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide it in PSD format. We would appreciate it if you could separate the background from the character, etc., as we may use it only for the character. Also, we would like the hair color and costume to be as shown in the following URL.\nhttp://dp01001873.lolipop.jp/image/Outfit3.png\n\nWe would be happy if you could draw it for us.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1307312, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "しば", "screen_name": "siva_speaklow", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1474317585433137153/eDEyC8AA.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/623687369/1414504394/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "music"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 1626449, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "井口 井", "screen_name": "shooiguchi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1955550535274336258/xPeWNlGG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1954817909085339648/1757893055/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, 